# Chrome Extension Rules

This project builds a Chrome Extension using Manifest V3.

---

# Extension Structure

Directory structure:

```

extension/
background/
content/
overlay/
popup/

```

---

# Content Script Rules

Content scripts must:

- avoid blocking page scripts
- avoid modifying page styles
- isolate injected UI

Use shadow DOM when needed.

---

# Overlay Rules

Overlay must:

- be non intrusive
- use pointer events carefully
- highlight elements accurately

---

# Permissions

Use minimal permissions.

Preferred:

```

activeTab
storage
scripting

```

Avoid unnecessary host permissions.

---

# Performance

DOM operations must be efficient.

Avoid:

```

full page traversal
expensive query selectors

```

---

# Storage

Use:

```

chrome.storage.local

```

Never store large binary data unnecessarily.
```